<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo sets 400 mln mark April 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo sets 400 mln mark April 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY   *23.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> DENOMS     ONE	 LISTING    UNDISC    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 23.APR.97, THEN 4.60 PCT IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 PFANDBRIEF 973</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
